<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>CSR | Vaswani Group</title>
    <style>
        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@400;700;900&display=swap');

        :root {
            --primary-font: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
            --dark-color: #1a1a1a;
            --light-color: #f5f5f5;
            --accent-color: #d4af37;
        }

        body {
            font-family: var(--primary-font);
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background-color: var(--light-color);
            color: var(--dark-color);
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 2rem;
            text-align: center;
        }

        h1, h4 {
            font-family: var(--primary-font);
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: -1px;
            margin: 0;
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 8vw, 6rem);
            font-weight: 900;
            line-height: 1;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }

        h4 {
            font-size: clamp(1rem, 3vw, 2.5rem);
            font-weight: 700;
            line-height: 1.2;
            margin-top: 2rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        p {
            font-size: clamp(0.9rem, 1.5vw, 1.1rem);
            font-weight: 400;
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 1rem auto;
        }
        
        .hero {
            position: relative;
            height: 80vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            flex-direction: column;
            color: white;
            text-shadow: 2px 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.7);
            background-image: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1549880338-65ddcdfd017b?crop=entropy&cs=tinysrgb&fit=max&fm=jpg&ixid=M3w1NjY5MzB8MHwxfHNlYXJjaHwxNXx8YmFuZ2Fsb3JlJTIwY2l0eXxlbnwwfHx8fDE3MTcwMDM2MzZ8MA&ixlib=rb-4.0.3&q=80&w=1080');
            background-size: cover;
            background-position: center;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .hero::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            right: 0;
            bottom: 0;
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
            z-index: 1;
        }

        .hero * {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 2;
        }

        .content-section {
            padding: 4rem 0;
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        }

        .content-section img {
            width: 100%;
            height: auto;
            border-radius: 8px;
            margin: 2rem 0;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }

        .grid-container {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
            gap: 2rem;
            margin-top: 3rem;
        }

        .grid-item {
            background-color: var(--dark-color);
            color: var(--light-color);
            padding: 2rem;
            border-radius: 8px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .grid-item img {
            width: 100px;
            height: auto;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            filter: grayscale(100%) brightness(200%);
            transition: filter 0.3s ease;
        }

        .grid-item:hover img {
            filter: none;
        }
        
        .cta-section {
            background-color: var(--dark-color);
            color: var(--light-color);
            padding: 6rem 0;
        }
        
        .cta-button {
            background-color: var(--accent-color);
            color: var(--dark-color);
            text-decoration: none;
            padding: 1rem 2rem;
            border-radius: 50px;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
            display: inline-block;
        }
        
        .cta-button:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.3);
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="hero">
        <h1>Building Tomorrow. Today.</h1>
        <h4 style="font-weight: 400; max-width: 600px;">Our commitment to a sustainable, vibrant Bangalore is non-negotiable. This is our blueprint for impact.</h4>
    </div>

    <div class="container content-section">
        <h4 style="color: var(--accent-color);">Our Vision of Responsibility</h4>
        <p>At Vaswani Group, we believe true luxury is built on a foundation of responsibility. Our commitment extends beyond the beautiful spaces we create to the communities and environment we serve. This is our promise in action.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="container content-section">
        <h4>The Traffic Park: Where Learning Is an Adventure</h4>
        [cite_start]<p>A "first-of-its-kind" public-private initiative, we developed the **Police Traffic Park** in Bangalore, blending education with recreation in just 100 days[cite: 1]. [cite_start]The park features an amphitheater, jogging trails, and children's play areas, serving as a unique hub for the community[cite: 1].</p>
        <img loading="lazy" src="http://googleusercontent.com/image_generation_content/2" alt="A beautifully designed traffic park in Bangalore with children learning and playing.">
    </div>

    <div class="container content-section">
        <h4>Greening Our City: More Than Just Roads</h4>
        [cite_start]<p>We've actively contributed to **widening a crucial road in Whitefield**, a public-private collaboration that significantly improved urban connectivity[cite: 1]. [cite_start]Our commitment also extends to increasing green cover by actively **planting avenue trees** in the Mahadevapura area[cite: 1].</p>
        <img loading="lazy" src="http://googleusercontent.com/image_generation_content/1" alt="Lush, green trees lining a newly built road in an urban area.">
    </div>

    <div class="container content-section">
        <h4>Investing in Education: The Power of Knowledge</h4>
        <p>Through the **Vaswani Foundation**, we support and empower the future of our community. [cite_start]We've actively considered adopting the **Pattandur Village School** near our "Vaswani Pinnacle" project to provide immense benefit to hundreds of students[cite: 1, 10].</p>
        <img loading="lazy" src="http://googleusercontent.com/image_generation_content/3" alt="Smiling school children in a modern classroom.">
    </div>

    <div class="container content-section">
        <h4>Our Impact in Motion</h4>
        <div class="grid-container">
            <div class="grid-item">
                <img loading="lazy" src="http://googleusercontent.com/image_generation_content/0" alt="Iconic image of a renovated Bellandur Gram Panchayat Office.">
                <h4>Bellandur Panchayat Office</h4>
                [cite_start]<p>We designed and constructed the Gram Panchayat office in 1994-95, our first social initiative[cite: 1].</p>
            </div>
            <div class="grid-item">
                <img loading="lazy" src="https://via.placeholder.com/100/363636/ffffff?text=WATER+TANK" alt="Stylized icon of a water tank.">
                <h4>Water for Local Schools</h4>
                [cite_start]<p>A water tank was built to provide clean drinking water to local school children and the community[cite: 1].</p>
            </div>
            <div class="grid-item">
                <img loading="lazy" src="https://via.placeholder.com/100/363636/ffffff?text=ROAD+IMPROVEMENT" alt="Stylized icon of a road.">
                <h4>Road Asphalting</h4>
                [cite_start]<p>Completed the asphalting of a service road on the Airport-Sarjapur Ring Road to facilitate traffic flow[cite: 1].</p>
            </div>
            <div class="grid-item">
                <img loading="lazy" src="https://via.placeholder.com/100/363636/ffffff?text=TSUNAMI+RELIEF" alt="Stylized icon of hands clasped in solidarity.">
                <h4>Tsunami Relief</h4>
                [cite_start]<p>Made a sizeable contribution to the Prime Minister’s Relief Fund in solidarity with the victims[cite: 1].</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="cta-section">
        <div class="container">
            <h4>Ready to Build a Better Tomorrow?</h4>
            <p style="color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);">Our commitment is ongoing. If you share our vision for a sustainable and equitable future, we invite you to connect.</p>
            <a href="#" class="cta-button">Explore Partnerships</a>
        </div>
    </div>

</body>
</html>